    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Planets Ambrosia&quot; is a roguelite shooting game where you pilot a space fighter and eliminate grotesque enemies approaching from all 360 degrees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is to defeat bizarre bosses that are a fusion of fruit and machinery. You will constantly be plunged into intense battles. Defeat enemies and extract their juice to earn rewards. Use the acquired juice to upgrade your weapons and challenge even stronger foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic weapon choices and keen awareness of your surroundings will guide you to victory. Can you survive the endless cosmic threats and crush the ambitions of the alien bosses?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Planets Ambrosia&quot; is a roguelite shooting game where you pilot a space fighter and eliminate grotesque enemies approaching from all 360 degrees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is to defeat bizarre bosses that are a fusion of fruit and machinery. You will constantly be plunged into intense battles. Defeat enemies and extract their juice to earn rewards. Use the acquired juice to upgrade your weapons and challenge even stronger foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic weapon choices and keen awareness of your surroundings will guide you to victory. Can you survive the endless cosmic threats and crush the ambitions of the alien bosses?</p>",
    "short_description": "All-out 360-degree assault! A roguelite shooter where you pilot an sci-fi fighter to eliminate grotesque enemies fused with fruit and machinery, constantly upgrading your weaponry.",
